"▀─ Help ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
Keyboard reference                                                   │
                                                                     │
j/down / k/up      Move through revisions                            │
Tab                Switch revisions / preview focus                  │
p                  Toggle preview pane                               │
PgUp / PgDn        Scroll preview by page                            │
^P / ^N            Scroll preview by line, keeping graph focus       │
^U / ^D            Scroll preview by half page                       │
w                  Working-copy status                               │
^R                 Refresh history                                   │
L                  Enter a revset; empty restores all()              │
/                  Search descriptions, bookmarks and ID prefixes in │
revset                                                               │
' / "              Next / previous search match, wrapping            │
@ / [ / ]          Jump to working copy / parent / child             │
^O                 Return from temporary reveal                      │
Esc                Clear accepted search                             │
* / +             Search match / revision outside active revset      │
Enter              Describe selected change in the app, including    │
multiline                                                            │
D                  Describe selected change in JJ's configured editor│
e                  Make selection the working copy immediately       │
r / S              Choose rebase / squash destination in the graph   │
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
`;

